 "defect_observations": [
  "Theorems thm:p15-submartingale-ui (body 110-121) and thm:p15-closed-martingale (annex 234: 'Since X_n is integrable and F_n-measurable') rely on adaptedness of the (sub)martingale; per the packet's own duty for ED26-P15-CH-martingales-and-convergence-C001, def:p15-filtration-martingale does not require adaptedness. Not a coverage gap of this unit; it is resolved by the C001 fix in the other unit.",
  "annex 94-97 (annex:p15.ui-conditional-family): the closing sentence about 'convergence of event probabilities does not require pointwise convergence of their indicators' does not correspond to any step of the proof given; stray remark.",
  "body 257 (thm:p15-posterior-mean-consistency): 'known mean mu' adds a 'known' qualifier absent from Durrett Ex. 4.6.1; the proof only uses mu = E xi_i, so the qualifier is unnecessary.",
  "body 276-281 (thm:p15-extinction-or-escape): source Ex. 4.6.4 states the bound delta(x) for every real x on {X_n <= x}; the handbook uses positive integer K, which is implied by the source hypothesis (a recorded variant, not a gap)."
 ],
